 "evidence": "Statistics fitted to 36 seconds of one CC0 field recording each, on 11 October 2026: textures with no physical calibration. Rendered with their recorded seeds they reproduce the rain work's raw masters bit for bit, and the concrete and puddle models refit from their recordings to the same arrays (the puddles' to within 1e-16). The files are byte for byte those whose sha256 the lunar and stereo export manifests of 13 October record.",
 "reading_rule": "Load a model with texture.load(surface) and render with texture.synthesize(model, seconds, seed); a render reproduces only with the same model, seed, duration and numerical environment. A model's level is the recording's digital level, which fixes no sound pressure. archive_master gives the sha256 of the float32 little-endian samples of the archive's 30 s master and its peak and level; recovered_renderer_short_render the sha256 of a 3 s synthesis by the recovered code of 11 October in numpy 2.3.3 and scipy 1.16.2.",
